---
import Legal from "@/layouts/Legal.astro";
import { href } from "@/lib/utils";
---
<Legal title="Terms" description="Terms for the Iron Lantern Studios site.">
  <p>Iron Lantern Studios owns the text, art, code, 3D models and media on this site unless a page says otherwise. You can link to any page and share screenshots of it. You can't copy the art, models or project media and present them as your own work.</p>
  <p>Games and assets marked "In development" or "In progress" are unfinished. Their pages show what I'm building, and details can change before release.</p>
  <h2>Buying</h2>
  <p>"Buy here" buttons open a checkout page run by my payment provider. Prices are one-time payments, never subscriptions. The checkout page shows any sales tax before you pay.</p>
  <p>You can also get my games and assets on Steam, itch.io, Google Play, the App Store, Fab or Roblox. When you buy there, that store's terms apply alongside the license that comes with the item. The <a href={href("refunds")}>refund policy</a> explains what happens if something goes wrong.</p>
  <h2>Credits</h2>
  <p>The color theme starts from "Emerald Dark" by ndlprecieux on 21st.dev, and the tilting cards adapt "Tilt Card" by tom_ui on 21st.dev. Search runs on cmdk. The site uses Big Shoulders Display, Plus Jakarta Sans and Fira Code under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, Three.js, Lenis, Motion, Astro, React, Tailwind CSS and Phosphor Icons under the MIT License.</p>
</Legal>
